        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-10T06:38:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, it's worth noting that the Sentinels Comics publishing company (I don't remember if it had that name at the time, but you know what I mean) predates their superhero comics. &nbsp;They initially did Westerns. &nbsp;One of my favorite details in the Sentinels meta-universe is that Jim was a sheriff from their old cowboy comics whom they literally dragged through a time portal to make him Chrono-Ranger.</p>",
