        "raw": "<p>Also, it&#39;s worth noting that the Sentinels Comics publishing company (I don&#39;t remember if it had that name at the time, but you know what I mean) predates their superhero comics. &nbsp;They initially did Westerns. &nbsp;One of my favorite details in the Sentinels meta-universe is that Jim was a sheriff from their old cowboy comics whom they literally dragged through a time portal to make him Chrono-Ranger.</p>",
